that just keeps popping up, and that's the

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:01.199
dad that does not want dancing to happen.

00:01:01.199 --> 00:01:02.429
Oh.

00:01:02.429 --> 00:01:03.910
The no dance dad.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:04.910
The no dance dad.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:06.930
